{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wrinkle Your Brain  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Times Trials is an all-ages, arcade-style block-dropping puzzle game that will supercharge your math skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/7d825d0393e720666dd3bab7f4f33814.poster.avif?t=1756175214\" width=780 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/7d825d0393e720666dd3bab7f4f33814.webm?t=1756175214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/7d825d0393e720666dd3bab7f4f33814.mp4?t=1756175214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: arrange the falling number blocks to form rows or columns that equal the target number. As the blocks keep falling, you\u2019ll need lightning-quick thinking to make it through. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Much Math. Many Puzzles. Wow</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the clock in timed mode or go head-to-head against friends in versus battles. Choose from four operations: addition, subtraction, multiplication, or division. Play them across over 35 different levels and 3 game modes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/d8b070a0e9f95a39982d4f4d65c88dea.poster.avif?t=1756175214\" width=780 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/d8b070a0e9f95a39982d4f4d65c88dea.webm?t=1756175214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/d8b070a0e9f95a39982d4f4d65c88dea.mp4?t=1756175214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game caters to all skill levels, making it a perfect choice for students and math enthusiasts alike. Whether you\u2019re a beginner looking for a fun way to practice or a pro looking for a challenge, Times Trials is right for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >School Your Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiply the fun with multiplayer! Versus mode lets you show off your cool math skills.\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/726896178c3471296a3c6d8615dbc7d5.poster.avif?t=1756175214\" width=780 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/726896178c3471296a3c6d8615dbc7d5.webm?t=1756175214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/726896178c3471296a3c6d8615dbc7d5.mp4?t=1756175214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cute Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/95644240e61de7aa3bf854d8cccdc348.poster.avif?t=1756175214\" width=780 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/95644240e61de7aa3bf854d8cccdc348.webm?t=1756175214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/95644240e61de7aa3bf854d8cccdc348.mp4?t=1756175214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made by Excellent People</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Times Trials has had the honor to have industry veterans be a part of the development. These veterans have come from 